            <p itemprop="description" class="description">
                7-Zip is a file archiver with a high compression ratio. 7-Zip works in Windows 11 / 10 / 8 / 7 / Vista / XP / 2022 / 2019 / 2016 / 2012 / 2008 / 2003 / 2000.<br>
You can use 7-Zip on any computer, including a computer in a commercial organization. You don&#39;t need to register or pay for 7-Zip.  And there is command line version for Linux and macOS. Most of the source code is under the GNU LGPL license. The unRAR code is under a mixed license with GNU LGPL + unRAR restrictions. Check the license for details.
            </p>
            
    </div>
</section>



        
        
        
        
